Package: org.legacyshazam.smoke
Name: ShazamX
Version: 0.3.8
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Song recognition for Shazam 5.5.1 on iOS 6 and Shazam 7.2.0 on iOS 7.
 .
 Netrun is the default recognition server. Render remains available in Settings.
 .
 Shows Listening and Sending inline and supports tagging from the bottom Shazam tab.
 .
 Shazam 5.5.1 uses frequency-reactive ring movement. Shazam 7.2.0 restores the flat idle ring after recognition.
 .
 Known limitation: opening a saved tag can remain on the loading screen.
 .
 Enable or disable ShazamX in Settings > ShazamX.
